        "body": {
          "en": "Averages, spread and the probability of simple events round out the syllabus.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — Data & chance",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "The mean is total over count; the median is the middle value; probability \\( =\\tfrac{\\text{favourable}}{\\text{total}} \\); independent events multiply.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Mean",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
