        "label": {
          "en": "Practice Problem",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "A data set has values: 8, 12, 10, 15, 10, 14, 11. Find the mean, median, mode, and range. <details><summary>Show solution</summary><div>Ordered: 8, 10, 10, 11, 12, 14, 15. Mean\\(=(8+10+10+11+12+14+15)/7=80/7\\approx11.4.\\) Median\\(=11\\) (4th value). Mode\\(=10.\\) Range\\(=15-8=7.\\)</div></details>",
          "ar": null
        }
